        "id": "R1",
        "text": "A series' monitored flag is changed only when the request supplies a Monitored value for it."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Api.V3|M:Sonarr.Api.V3.SeasonPass.SeasonPassController.UpdateAll(Sonarr.Api.V3.SeasonPass.SeasonPassResource)"
        ],
        "id": "R2",
        "text": "When seasons are supplied for a series, each existing season whose number matches gets the supplied monitored value; non-matching seasons are unchanged."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Api.V3|M:Sonarr.Api.V3.SeasonPass.SeasonPassController.UpdateAll(Sonarr.Api.V3.SeasonPass.SeasonPassResource)"
        ],
        "id": "R3",
        "text": "If the monitoring option is None, the series is set to not monitored."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Tv.EpisodeMonitoredService.SetEpisodeMonitoredStatus(NzbDrone.Core.Tv.Series,NzbDrone.Core.Tv.MonitoringOptions)"
